stele.talisman_jackiechan.lo_pei.front.m:
The Fire Demon laid waste the plains;
Lord Lo with his spell did quell him.
The talisman stones were scattered abroad throughout the world;
He bequeathed blessings unto ten thousand generations, and gave peace.
Though his body hath passed, his spirit abideth on high.
Lofty standeth the shrine;
Year by year are the offerings made.
Let every one that holdeth office look upon this stone.
